* lna-b2-cascode: common-gate with cascode gain stage for higher output impedance
* Add cascode transistor NM2 in drain path of NM1, shared gate bias network
C C1 VIN1 n0
L L1 n0 VSS
NMOS NM1 n2 n1 n0 VSS
NMOS NM2 n2 n3 n3 VSS
L L2 VDD n2
C C2 n2 VOUT1
R R1 VDD n3
NMOS NM3 n3 n3 VSS VSS
R R2 n3 n1
C Cbyp n1 VSS